<title>USA: Paging Network issues $500 mln 144A debt.</title>
<headline>Paging Network issues $500 mln 144A debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144A private placement debt issue was priced on Thursday, according to market sources. The issue was increased in size by $150 million, the sources said.</p>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co and Salomon Brothers Inc are co-lead</p>
<p>managers on the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER PAGING NETWORK INC</p>
<p>AMT $500 MLN	  COUPON 10.0 PCT   MATURITY 10/15/2008</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES  ISS PRICE 100.00  PAY DATE 4/15/1997 LAST MOODY B2	 SPREAD 343 BP     PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B   YIELD 10.0 PCT    CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTES PRICED OVER 10-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>--U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
